<title>USA: FPA Medical, AHI complete merger.</title>
<headline>FPA Medical, AHI complete merger.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>FPA Medical Management Inc and AHI Healthcare Systems Inc said they completed a merger in which each share of AHI common stock was exchanged for .391 shares of FPA.</p>
<p>The transaction price was based of FPA's average closing price of $22.99 during the measurement period. The companies said the total purchase price came to about $117 million.</p>
<p>The merger will add more than 200,000 HMO enrollees to FPA's affiliated physician network.</p>
</text>
